  "body": "This beautifully constructed home in the prosperous new area of Long Bay will have you calling your broker and reaching for your pen. Just a stone's throw from the shops and centre of Long Bay on an elevated site, you will love the sea views and proximity to the beach and Long Bay Regional Park.\r\n\r\nTo take full advantage of the views, the spacious, open plan kitchen, living and dining area is on the first floor, opening out to a sunny deck. The high stud adds to the sense of airiness and light - it is a wonderful place for the family to gather and enjoy the fabulous sea views. The striking kitchen is equipped with top of the range appliances and is brightly lit from the large window, making cooking and entertaining even more enjoyable.\r\n\r\nThe sumptuous master bedroom opens off this area and boasts a sizeable walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. Three further bedrooms are found on the lower level, including a second bedroom with its own ensuite that opens out to a sunny deck - perfect for airflow in the warmer, summer months.\r\n\r\nFor convenience and a touch of something special, this home will really tick the boxes and make your heart sing, but don't just take our word for it - check it out for yourself!",
